# Start_Child (SUP-001, docs/otp-supervision-study.md): supervision-check
# is a supervisor whose start-children scope is its may_launch list. It
# has procmgr start supervision-child.app with typed parameters, takes the
# child's exit event, checks procmgr's typed refusals, then ends with a
# child still running, which procmgr must reap.
(startup v1
  (start "logstore.svc" (priority 5))
  (start "supervision-check.app" (priority 3))
)
